he world while Sun Red battles against them. Other evil organisations and heroes are also mentioned from time to time.\n\nEach episode is divided into various shorts of varying length. Most of the humour comes from the interactions of the characters, especially the main trio of Sunred, his girlfriend Kayoko and General Vamp. Kayoko and Vamp, for example, get along very well and she occasionally consults him about housework or cooking. In contrast, she and Sunred often argue like a long married couple.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia)"},"tags":[{"name":"Parody","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Superhero","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Food","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tokusatsu","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Criminal Organization","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Tentai Senshi Sunred","english":null,"native":"天体戦士サンレッド","romaji":"Tentai Senshi Sunred","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"天体战士"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}